{global, key=help_main
    {help_home
        {message
            output={@
Welcome to the DarkWorld help system.

#[#ffff00] **? commands**# : Commands Help
#[#ffff00] **? notes**# : Notes Help




            }
        }
    }

    {help_commands
        {message
            output={@
Interactive Fiction follows some common conventions. The commands below are some of these:

#[#ffff00]**stats**# : View your player's stats.
#[#ffff00]**inv**# : View your current inventory.
#[#ffff00]**l or look**# : To look around.
#[#ffff00]**story**# : To replays the room's BRIEF description.
#[#ffff00]**?hint**# : To display possible hints.
#[#ffff00]**x (object) or examine (object)**# : To examine the specified object.
#[#ffff00]**x (person/etc) or examine (person/etc)**# : To interact with people or animate 'things' within the game.
#[#ffff00]**l behind (object) or x behind (object)**# : To look behind the specified object.
#[#ffff00]**l on (object) or x on (object)**# : To look behind the specified object.
#[#ffff00]**l under (object) or x under (object)**# : To look behind the specified object.
#[#ffff00]**l in (object) or x in (object)**# : To look behind the specified object.
#[#ffff00]**take (object) or pick up (object)**# : To pick up the specified object.
#[#ffff00]**drop (object)**# : To drop the specified object.
#[#ffff00]**arm (object)**# : To arm the player with the specified weapon.
#[#ffff00]**put (object) in (another object)**# : To put the specified object into another specified object.

#[#ffff00]**save**# : Save your game.

In this game, if you want to attack an opponent, use the following:
#[#ffff00] **! (opponent to attack)**# : Attack the opponent.




            }
        }
    }

    {help_notes
        {message
            output={@
While you are playing DarkWorld you can take basic notes.
This allows you to refer back to clues that you've found or other useful bits of information.

#[#ffff00]**!noteadd (*note id*|*note text*)**# : Creates a new note.
#[#ffff00]**!notedelete (note id)**# : Deletes the selected note.
#[#ffff00]**!note (note id)**# : Views the selected note.
#[#ffff00]**!notes**# : Lists out all the currently saved notes.
#[#ffff00]**!notes (search string)**# : Lists the notes according to the filter.
            }
        }
    }



    {input, syntax=^\?$|^help$
        {act, logic=help_home, tags=!_type|self }
    }

    {input, syntax=^\? commands$|^help commands$
        {act, logic=help_commands, tags=!_type|self }
    }

    {input, syntax=^\? notes$|^help notes$
        {act, logic=help_notes, tags=!_type|self }
    }
}
